# License

This repository uses split licensing.

## Code

Code, scripts, and software components created in this repository are licensed under the Apache License 2.0. See `LICENSE-CODE`.

## Documentation and Reconstruction Notes

Original documentation, formula-library notes, audit notes, tables created by this project, and other project-authored prose are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International. See `LICENSE-DOCS`.

## Exclusions

Third-party source material is not covered by either project license. This includes copied or downloaded PDFs, ZIP files, XLSM workbooks, scans, OCR outputs derived from third-party sources, and other materials listed under `01_sources/` or generated under `07_outputs/`.

Those materials remain subject to their original rights and licenses. This repository should store metadata, provenance, and project-authored analysis rather than redistributing third-party source files unless explicit permission or a compatible license is documented.
